    "text": "Role: Conductor, organist, educator\nAffiliation: Tuskegee University (Director of Choral Activities since 2001; Interim Chair, Fine and Performing Arts)\nLocation: Tuskegee, AL\nBio: Longtime successor to Dawson's Tuskegee legacy; led the Tuskegee Choir's 40th anniversary return to Lincoln Center and its 2015 Edmund Pettus Bridge performance with John Legend and Common.\nTags: black-sacred, collegiate, hbcu",
