    "title": "Wendell P. Whalum",
    "text": "Role: Conductor, composer, scholar\nAffiliation: Morehouse College Glee Club (Director, 1953–1987)\nLocation: Atlanta, GA\nBio: Shaped Morehouse Glee Club into the preeminent HBCU male choir of the 20th century. His spirituals arrangements and scholarship anchor the AUC choral tradition.\nTags: black-sacred, composer-arranger, collegiate, hbcu, georgia-atlanta, historical",
