    "text": "Role: Conductor, educator\nAffiliation: Luther College (Nordic Choir, 1948–2005)\nBio: Directed the Luther College Nordic Choir for 57 years; one of the defining figures of the American Lutheran college choir tradition.\nTags: collegiate, historical",
