    "pageTitle": "Choral Education",
    "title": "Career-Changers",
    "text": "Already have a bachelor's? Go straight to Sections 2.4–2.6 (MAT, post-bacc, alternative certification), then Part V (exams), Part VI (state licensure), and Part IX (choral skills if coming from performance).",
