    "title": "Doctoral Pathways",
    "text": "DMA in Choral Conducting — terminal performance degree; leads to college conducting positions. PhD in Music Education — research degree; leads to college music ed faculty. EdD — applied research; leads to district leadership, curriculum positions, or college ed faculty.",
